ses, so that downstream formatting logic involving breaking up lines depending on line length get the same input regardless of whether `((({atom})))` or `({atom})` is attempting to be formatted.\r\n\r\nOpen to feedback on this solution and additional test cases I can throw at it; tried to be conservative w.r.t. how these parens are deduped.\r\n\r\nAs an aside, perhaps in a future PR we can refactor how `maybe_make_parens_invisible_in_atom` looks.  Currently, it's responsible for returning a boolean *and* causing side-effects, which isn't obvious off the bat.  I added a comment to clarify this for now.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/961/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/comments/517959375","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/black/issues/836#issuecomment-517959375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/836","id":517959375,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNzk1OTM3NQ==","user":{"login":"Jma353","id":10677768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjc3NzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10677768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353","html_url":"https://github.com/Jma353","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jma353/events{/privacy